            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Described herein is an aerosol-generating amorphous solid comprising an active ingredient, wherein when a sheet of the aerosol-generating amorphous solid having an area of 43.1 mm2 and area density of 90 g/m2 is heated to 230 °C for a period of 3 seconds under a 1.1 L/min airflow, at least 50wt% of the active ingredient is aerosolised.</p>
